    <string name="about_title">ABOUT</string>
    <string name="about_text">The whole analysis runs on your phone. The app reads installed applications, looks for known tracking libraries in their code and combines that with permissions. Nothing is uploaded.\n\nThe app reports what is present in the code — not what is happening right now. The signature list is not complete, so it under-reports rather than exaggerates.</string>
